SNP_RLC_Extractor
commit:  $Format:%H$
short:   $Format:%h$
date:    $Format:%cI$
subject: $Format:%s$

(In a git work tree these stay literal $Format:...$ placeholders. They are
 substituted only when the red-zone package is built by `git archive` --
 see deploy/README.md. So a VERSION full of placeholders means "you are
 looking at a git checkout", and real values mean "this is a deployed
 package".)
